Cheren: {VAR 0100 0000}! {VAR BE01}
I understand the feeling.
I want to go somewhere with{VAR BE00}
my Pokémon too, but first{VAR BE00}
we have to go thank Professor Juniper.{VAR BE01}
Come on. The lab is this way!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: I'm sorry, but could you
go to Bianca's house?{VAR BE01}
I'll bet she's spacing out
like she usually does.{VAR BE00}
She's totally flighty.

Mom: Oh, there you are! And...?
What did the professor have to say?{VAR BE01}
She asked you to complete the Pokédex?!
I can't believe it!{VAR BE01}

Mom: As for your room, {VAR 0100 0000}--
or what's left of it...{VAR BE01}
No need for any of you to worry.
I'll take care of tidying up.{VAR BE01}
OK, {VAR 0100 0000}?{VAR BE01}

Mom: Ah, Pokémon. They are so cute,
but they have enough power to destroy{VAR BE00}
a bedroom! They are really something.{VAR BE01}
With Pokémon like that at your side,
you'll be safe wherever you go!{VAR BE01}

I'll let your parents know!{VAR BE01}
I hope that, in addition to Pokémon,
you'll find lots and lots of places{VAR BE00}
you like in the Unova region--{VAR BE00}
and become wonderful adults!{VAR BE01}
Have a great trip!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: If I use the Town Map,
I'll always know where I am...{VAR BE00}
That's certainly helpful.{VAR BE01}
Shall we head to Route 1?
The professor's waiting.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Bianca says if we're starting a
journey together, she wants us all to{VAR BE00}
take our first step at the same time.{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Hey, {VAR 0100 0000}!{VAR BE01}
Let's all take our first step
on Route 1 together!{VAR BE01}

The power of science is amazing!{VAR BE01}
Now you can use infrared to do all
sorts of things in the blink of an eye!

Bianca: ...I'm sorry.{VAR BE01}
By the time I went to get the
Striaton City Gym Leaders,{VAR BE00}
everything was over...{VAR BE01}

Cheren: If that's the case...{VAR BE01}
I let Ghetsis escape when the
Shadow Triad created an opening.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: I'll tell you later about what
happened in the castle.{VAR BE01}
It's more important to ask what you plan
to do now, Bianca.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: That's the city on the other side
of Route 16 when you leave from{VAR BE00}
Nimbasa City. Hmm.{VAR BE01}
If you go that way, you might be able to
meet all sorts of Pokémon{VAR BE00}
you've never seen before.{VAR BE01}

Cedric: Oh!
Well, this is nice timing!{VAR BE00}
I see you're all here!{VAR BE01}

Just a moment ago, I got some National
Pokédex data from an acquaintance.{VAR BE01}
Since you're here, let's upgrade your
Pokédex with the National Pokédex data.{VAR BE01}
I'm sure you'll be visiting a wider range
of places. Naturally, that means{VAR BE00}
you'll be encountering more Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
Let me see your Pokédex for a sec!{VAR BE01}

Cedric: You can now switch your
Pokédexes to the National Mode Pokédex.{VAR BE01}
Completing the National Pokédex will
surely be a big challenge.{VAR BE01}
So, take your time, enjoy yourselves,
and meet lots of Pokémon.{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Wow, the National Pokédex...{VAR BE01}
It looks like there are tons of Pokémon
I don't know yet! {VAR BE01}
Oh! Ooh! I want to show Mom and Dad
my Pokédex! I gotta go!{VAR BE01}
Let's meet again somewhere, OK?!{VAR BE01}

I think I'll travel all the way around
Unova, starting at Route 1 again.{VAR BE01}
I'm sure I'll discover lots of new things.{VAR BE01}
Could be I'll encounter the Seven Sages
along the way...{VAR BE01}
And, {VAR 0100 0000}, if we spy each other
along the way, let's battle again, OK?{VAR BE01}
